    <kabod:contentNotes>Source page advertises 22 parts; the actual sermon list contains 23 entries (covers Leviticus 1–27). Original preaching dates are not catalogued by the source — pubDate is set to the start of Still's Aberdeen ministry as a placeholder; ordering follows the source's canonical sequence.</kabod:contentNotes>
